§§ P2.2 : GRAMMAR-TOLERANCE for GLYPH-TABLES
  problem : handoff.csl files w/ glyph-tables + prose-in-cells trip parser
  scope : ADDITIVE new-context ← ¬ break-existing-parse
  approach :
    a introduce "prose-context" marker ← explicit opt-in
    b within marker : relaxed-grammar accepts arbitrary-content
    c markers : §{prose} ... §{/prose} OR leading-§§P tag
    d tables specifically : recognize markdown-table-shape in-prose-context
  files-modified (additive) :
    parser/parser.odin : new-grammar-production for-prose-context
    parser/token.odin : new token-kinds .Prose_Open .Prose_Close (if-chosen)
    parser/pprint.odin : preserve prose-content verbatim in-all-modes
    parser/ast.odin : new Prose_Block node
    tests/test_prose_context.py : ~150-LOC
    tests/prose_context/ : fixtures incl. past-handoffs
