§ WHEN-STUCK ← §§ no-half-measures-protocol
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  1 : re-read STABILITY.md + DECISIONS.md
  2 : check Session-11 m₂ patterns for-harness-reuse
  3 : try 3+ angles :
      a : model-variant (swap Qwen ↔ Llama ↔ Mistral on-failure)
      b : abstraction-shift (file-level vs token-level)
      c : decomposition-refactor
      d : prior-art-adaptation (lm-eval-harness • HELM • BIG-bench)
  4 : consult sibling-session-handoffs
  5 : still-stuck → Q?-block to Apocky
    W! explicit-uncertainty + concrete-options + recommendation
    N! silent-simplification
    N! "skip-for-now"
    N! un-flagged-TODO
    N! reducing-scope-unilaterally

  pre-authorized fallbacks :
    model-download-fails → retry + mirror-alternate OR Apocky-manual-place
    model-too-slow → drop-to-2-models + document
    paraphrase-quality below-threshold → Apocky-review-rewrite
    grammar-tolerance edge-case → narrow-scope + document
    SQLite file-corruption → auto-rebuild + log
    LoRA-training OOM → reduce-rank OR reduce-seq-len
    fine-tune non-convergent → report-as-negative-result (valid finding)
