  Release-candidate conventions :
    -rc.1 -rc.2 ... -rc.N for-iterations
    promote to-final when blocker-free
    never-reuse rc-number post-promotion
  LoRA foundations :
    low-rank adaptation of-attention-matrices
    rank 8-16 typical for domain-adaptation
    freeze base-weights + train adapter-only
    adapter ≈ 1-5MB for-1B model
  Fine-tune as-density-validation :
    hypothesis : if density-claim valid, small-model learns quickly
    falsification : if m₂ doesn't-converge, claim weakens
    valid negative-result : honest-reporting matters
  Paraphrase-quality thresholds :
    cosine ≥ 0.7 : semantic-similarity acceptable
    entity-recall ≥ 0.8 : key-facts preserved
    Apocky-judgment ← final-authority
  Grammar-tolerance design :
    prose-context explicit-marker ← never-auto-promote
    ∵ auto-detect risks silent-corruption
    ∵ explicit-opt-in preserves existing-semantics
  SQLite persistence in-LSP :
    file-path identity : URI-based
    mtime + hash dual-check : detect-out-of-band-edit
    VACUUM periodic to-prevent-bloat

